{"id": 0, "schema_version": "3.0", "language": "en", "target": "cultural", "text": "The Brooklyn Poets collective opened its eighth annual Borough Slam at the Old Stone House in Park Slope on Saturday night, drawing about 140 attendees for what organizers called their largest local turnout to date.", "entities": [{"type": "ORG", "text": "Brooklyn Poets", "offset": [4, 18]}, {"type": "EVENT", "text": "Borough Slam", "offset": [55, 67]}, {"type": "FAC", "text": "Old Stone House", "offset": [75, 90]}, {"type": "LOC", "text": "Park Slope", "offset": [94, 104]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday night", "offset": [108, 122]}, {"type": "NUM", "text": "140", "offset": [138, 141]}], "domain_labels": ["cultural"], "events": [{"event_type": "cultural", "event_subtype": "PoetrySlam", "trigger": "opened", "slots": {"event_name": "Borough Slam", "venue": "Old Stone House", "city": "Park Slope", "organizers": ["Brooklyn Poets"], "actual_attendance": 140, "start_date": "Saturday night"}, "trigger_offset": [30, 36]}]}
{"id": 1, "schema_version": "3.0", "language": "en", "target": "cultural", "text": "A new ensemble play tracing four generations of steelworkers' families opens at the Crucible Studio in Sheffield on Thursday, marking the venue's first commission from local writer Imogen Hawkridge. The 95-minute piece, titled Forge, features a six-strong cast drawn from amateur dramatic societies across South Yorkshire and runs until 24 May. Director Niamh Caulfield said rehearsals had been built around the cast's day jobs. Tickets are priced at £14, with a pay-what-you-can policy on the final Wednesday.", "entities": [{"type": "FAC", "text": "Crucible Studio", "offset": [84, 99]}, {"type": "LOC", "text": "Sheffield", "offset": [103, 112]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "offset": [116, 124]}, {"type": "PER", "text": "Imogen Hawkridge", "offset": [181, 197]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "95-minute", "offset": [203, 212]}, {"type": "EVENT", "text": "Forge", "offset": [227, 232]}, {"type": "LOC", "text": "South Yorkshire", "offset": [306, 321]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "24 May", "offset": [337, 343]}, {"type": "PER", "text": "Niamh Caulfield", "offset": [354, 369]}, {"type": "MONEY", "text": "£14", "offset": [451, 454]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "final Wednesday", "offset": [494, 509]}], "domain_labels": ["cultural"], "events": [{"event_type": "cultural", "event_subtype": "Premiere", "trigger": "opens", "slots": {"event_name": "Forge", "venue": "Crucible Studio", "city": "Sheffield", "artists": ["Imogen Hawkridge"], "directors": ["Niamh Caulfield"], "start_date": "Thursday", "end_date": "24 May", "duration": "95-minute", "ticket_price": "£14"}, "trigger_offset": [71, 76]}]}
{"id": 2, "schema_version": "3.0", "language": "de", "target": "cultural", "text": "Mit der Eröffnung der Ausstellung „Eisenbahn und Erinnerung“ hat das Historische Museum Frankfurt am Donnerstagabend seine neue Sonderschau gestartet. Im Mittelpunkt stehen rund 180 Objekte aus den Beständen des Deutschen Bahnmuseums sowie zwölf Leihgaben aus Privatsammlungen, die der Kurator Hans-Jürgen Reibl gemeinsam mit der Düsseldorfer Historikerin Eva Kropp zusammengetragen hat. Die Schau, zu der etwa 320 geladene Gäste erschienen, läuft bis zum 14. September.", "entities": [{"type": "EVENT", "text": "Eisenbahn und Erinnerung", "offset": [35, 59]}, {"type": "FAC", "text": "Historische Museum Frankfurt", "offset": [69, 97]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "Donnerstagabend", "offset": [101, 116]}, {"type": "NUM", "text": "180", "offset": [178, 181]}, {"type": "ORG", "text": "Deutschen Bahnmuseums", "offset": [212, 233]}, {"type": "NUM", "text": "zwölf", "offset": [240, 245]}, {"type": "PER", "text": "Hans-Jürgen Reibl", "offset": [294, 311]}, {"type": "LOC", "text": "Düsseldorfer", "offset": [330, 342]}, {"type": "PER", "text": "Eva Kropp", "offset": [356, 365]}, {"type": "NUM", "text": "320", "offset": [411, 414]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "14. September", "offset": [456, 469]}], "domain_labels": ["cultural"], "events": [{"event_type": "cultural", "event_subtype": "Exhibition", "trigger": "Eröffnung", "slots": {"event_name": "Eisenbahn und Erinnerung", "venue": "Historische Museum Frankfurt", "curators": ["Hans-Jürgen Reibl", "Eva Kropp"], "actual_attendance": 320, "start_date": "Donnerstagabend", "end_date": "14. September"}, "trigger_offset": [8, 17]}]}
