{"id": 4, "schema_version": "3.0", "language": "en", "target": "mobility", "text": "Metrolink trams across Greater Manchester will come to a standstill on Thursday and Friday after drivers voted to walk out over rota changes. Operator KeolisAmey said all eight tram lines would be suspended from 04:00 on Thursday until early Saturday morning, with around 240,000 daily journeys expected to be affected. Talks between the operator and the RMT broke down on Tuesday evening.", "entities": [{"type": "ORG", "text": "Metrolink", "offset": [0, 9]}, {"type": "LOC", "text": "Greater Manchester", "offset": [23, 41]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday and Friday", "offset": [71, 90]}, {"type": "ORG", "text": "KeolisAmey", "offset": [151, 161]}, {"type": "MISC", "text": "all eight tram lines", "offset": [167, 187]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "04:00 on Thursday", "offset": [212, 229]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "early Saturday morning", "offset": [236, 258]}, {"type": "NUM", "text": "240,000", "offset": [272, 279]}, {"type": "ORG", "text": "RMT", "offset": [355, 358]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday evening", "offset": [373, 388]}, {"type": "MISC", "text": "rota changes", "offset": [128, 140]}], "domain_labels": ["mobility"], "events": [{"event_type": "mobility", "event_subtype": "TransportStrike", "trigger": "walk out", "slots": {"city": "Greater Manchester", "operator": "KeolisAmey", "affected_lines": ["all eight tram lines"], "start_date": "04:00 on Thursday", "end_date": "early Saturday morning", "estimated_affected_passengers": 240000, "reason": "rota changes", "ongoing": false}, "trigger_offset": [114, 122]}]}
{"id": 5, "schema_version": "3.0", "language": "de", "target": "mobility", "text": "Die U2 wird in Wien zwischen Schottentor und Karlsplatz von Freitagabend bis Montag früh komplett gesperrt, um den letzten Streckenabschnitt für die Verlängerung Richtung Matzleinsdorfer Platz an das bestehende Netz anzuschließen. Wie die Wiener Linien am Mittwoch mitteilten, sind insgesamt 71 Stunden Sperre vorgesehen, in denen rund 134.000 tägliche Fahrgäste auf einen Schienenersatzverkehr mit zwölf Bussen sowie auf die Straßenbahnlinien D, 71 und 1 ausweichen müssen. Die Verlängerung der U2 soll planmäßig im Herbst 2027 in Betrieb gehen.", "entities": [{"type": "MISC", "text": "U2", "offset": [4, 6]}, {"type": "LOC", "text": "Wien", "offset": [15, 19]}, {"type": "FAC", "text": "Schottentor", "offset": [29, 40]}, {"type": "FAC", "text": "Karlsplatz", "offset": [45, 55]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "Freitagabend", "offset": [60, 72]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "Montag früh", "offset": [77, 88]}, {"type": "FAC", "text": "Matzleinsdorfer Platz", "offset": [171, 192]}, {"type": "ORG", "text": "Wiener Linien", "offset": [239, 252]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "Mittwoch", "offset": [256, 264]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "71 Stunden", "offset": [292, 302]}, {"type": "NUM", "text": "134.000", "offset": [336, 343]}, {"type": "NUM", "text": "zwölf", "offset": [399, 404]}, {"type": "MISC", "text": "Straßenbahnlinien D, 71 und 1", "offset": [426, 455]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "Herbst 2027", "offset": [517, 528]}], "domain_labels": ["mobility"], "events": [{"event_type": "mobility", "event_subtype": "TransitDisruption", "trigger": "komplett gesperrt", "slots": {"city": "Wien", "operator": "Wiener Linien", "affected_lines": ["U2"], "start_date": "Freitagabend", "end_date": "Montag früh", "duration": "71 Stunden", "estimated_affected_passengers": 134000, "ongoing": false}, "trigger_offset": [89, 106]}]}
{"id": 6, "schema_version": "3.0", "language": "en", "target": "mobility", "text": "Bristol's long-delayed e-bike scheme finally launched on Monday morning, with 600 vehicles distributed across 80 stations from Bedminster to Stoke Bishop. The £4.2 million programme, run by Beryl on a five-year contract with Bristol City Council, will cost users £1 to unlock plus 12p per minute. Council transport lead Aamir Khan-Rashid said the rollout had taken eighteen months longer than planned.", "entities": [{"type": "LOC", "text": "Bristol", "offset": [0, 7]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "Monday morning", "offset": [57, 71]}, {"type": "NUM", "text": "600", "offset": [78, 81]}, {"type": "NUM", "text": "80", "offset": [110, 112]}, {"type": "LOC", "text": "Bedminster", "offset": [127, 137]}, {"type": "LOC", "text": "Stoke Bishop", "offset": [141, 153]}, {"type": "MONEY", "text": "£4.2 million", "offset": [159, 171]}, {"type": "ORG", "text": "Beryl", "offset": [190, 195]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "five-year", "offset": [201, 210]}, {"type": "ORG", "text": "Bristol City Council", "offset": [225, 245]}, {"type": "MONEY", "text": "£1", "offset": [263, 265]}, {"type": "MONEY", "text": "12p", "offset": [281, 284]}, {"type": "PER", "text": "Aamir Khan-Rashid", "offset": [320, 337]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "eighteen months", "offset": [365, 380]}], "domain_labels": ["mobility"], "events": [{"event_type": "mobility", "event_subtype": "BikeShareLaunch", "trigger": "launched", "slots": {"city": "Bristol", "operator": "Beryl", "start_date": "Monday morning", "fleet_size": 600, "n_stations": 80, "contract_value": "£4.2 million", "duration": "five-year"}, "trigger_offset": [45, 53]}]}
