{"id": 14, "schema_version": "3.0", "language": "en", "target": "politics", "text": "Labour comfortably held the Rochdale parliamentary seat in Thursday's by-election, with candidate Sarah Wainwright taking 47.3% of the vote on a 38% turnout. The Conservatives slipped to fourth place behind Reform UK and the Liberal Democrats, polling just 9.1%. Returning officer Margaret Chen-Doherty announced the result shortly after 02:00 on Friday.", "entities": [{"type": "ORG", "text": "Labour", "offset": [0, 6]}, {"type": "LOC", "text": "Rochdale", "offset": [28, 36]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "offset": [59, 67]}, {"type": "EVENT", "text": "by-election", "offset": [70, 81]}, {"type": "PER", "text": "Sarah Wainwright", "offset": [98, 114]}, {"type": "MISC", "text": "47.3%", "offset": [122, 127]}, {"type": "MISC", "text": "38%", "offset": [145, 148]}, {"type": "ORG", "text": "Conservatives", "offset": [162, 175]}, {"type": "ORG", "text": "Reform UK", "offset": [207, 216]}, {"type": "ORG", "text": "Liberal Democrats", "offset": [225, 242]}, {"type": "MISC", "text": "9.1%", "offset": [257, 261]}, {"type": "PER", "text": "Margaret Chen-Doherty", "offset": [281, 302]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "02:00 on Friday", "offset": [338, 353]}], "domain_labels": ["politics"], "events": [{"event_type": "politics", "event_subtype": "Election", "trigger": "held", "slots": {"event_name": "by-election", "city": "Rochdale", "event_date": "Thursday", "winning_party": "Labour", "losing_party": "Conservatives", "vote_share": "47.3%", "turnout": "38%", "key_politicians": ["Sarah Wainwright", "Margaret Chen-Doherty"], "key_parties": ["Labour", "Conservatives", "Reform UK", "Liberal Democrats"]}, "trigger_offset": [19, 23]}]}
{"id": 15, "schema_version": "3.0", "language": "de", "target": "politics", "text": "Der Bundestag hat am Freitag das Gesetz zur Reform der Pflegeversicherung in dritter Lesung verabschiedet. Mit 412 Ja-Stimmen bei 198 Gegenstimmen und 14 Enthaltungen passierte die Vorlage der Ampel-Koalition aus SPD, Grünen und FDP das Parlament, während CDU/CSU und AfD geschlossen dagegen votierten. Gesundheitsminister Friedrich Heimann sprach von einem Generationenwerk.", "entities": [{"type": "ORG", "text": "Bundestag", "offset": [4, 13]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "Freitag", "offset": [21, 28]}, {"type": "MISC", "text": "Reform der Pflegeversicherung", "offset": [44, 73]}, {"type": "MISC", "text": "dritter Lesung", "offset": [77, 91]}, {"type": "NUM", "text": "412", "offset": [111, 114]}, {"type": "NUM", "text": "198", "offset": [130, 133]}, {"type": "NUM", "text": "14", "offset": [151, 153]}, {"type": "ORG", "text": "SPD", "offset": [213, 216]}, {"type": "ORG", "text": "Grünen", "offset": [218, 224]}, {"type": "ORG", "text": "FDP", "offset": [229, 232]}, {"type": "ORG", "text": "CDU/CSU", "offset": [256, 263]}, {"type": "ORG", "text": "AfD", "offset": [268, 271]}, {"type": "PER", "text": "Friedrich Heimann", "offset": [323, 340]}], "domain_labels": ["politics"], "events": [{"event_type": "politics", "event_subtype": "ParliamentaryVote", "trigger": "verabschiedet", "slots": {"event_date": "Freitag", "policy_topic": "Reform der Pflegeversicherung", "key_parties": ["SPD", "Grünen", "FDP", "CDU/CSU", "AfD"], "key_politicians": ["Friedrich Heimann"], "n_votes_for": 412, "n_votes_against": 198, "n_abstentions": 14, "organizers": ["Bundestag"]}, "trigger_offset": [92, 105]}]}
{"id": 16, "schema_version": "3.0", "language": "en", "target": "multi", "text": "The 31st Three Rivers Half Marathon set off from Point State Park in Pittsburgh on Sunday morning, with about 9,800 registered runners. Race officials said Wesley Akinwale took the men's title in 1:04:12, while Sara Malone won the women's race in 1:13:48. The Port Authority diverted four bus routes and closed the Boulevard of the Allies between 6 a.m. and noon.", "entities": [{"type": "EVENT", "text": "Three Rivers Half Marathon", "offset": [9, 35]}, {"type": "FAC", "text": "Point State Park", "offset": [49, 65]}, {"type": "LOC", "text": "Pittsburgh", "offset": [69, 79]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday morning", "offset": [83, 97]}, {"type": "NUM", "text": "9,800", "offset": [110, 115]}, {"type": "PER", "text": "Wesley Akinwale", "offset": [156, 171]}, {"type": "MISC", "text": "1:04:12", "offset": [196, 203]}, {"type": "PER", "text": "Sara Malone", "offset": [211, 222]}, {"type": "MISC", "text": "1:13:48", "offset": [247, 254]}, {"type": "ORG", "text": "Port Authority", "offset": [260, 274]}, {"type": "NUM", "text": "four", "offset": [284, 288]}, {"type": "FAC", "text": "Boulevard of the Allies", "offset": [315, 338]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "6 a.m. and noon", "offset": [347, 362]}], "domain_labels": ["sports", "mobility"], "events": [{"event_type": "sports", "event_subtype": "MarathonRace", "trigger": "set off", "slots": {"event_name": "Three Rivers Half Marathon", "venue": "Point State Park", "city": "Pittsburgh", "event_date": "Sunday morning", "winner": "Wesley Akinwale", "key_players": ["Wesley Akinwale", "Sara Malone"], "attendance": 9800}, "trigger_offset": [36, 43]}, {"event_type": "mobility", "event_subtype": "RoadClosure", "trigger": "closed", "slots": {"city": "Pittsburgh", "operator": "Port Authority", "affected_routes": ["Boulevard of the Allies"], "duration": "6 a.m. and noon", "reason": "Three Rivers Half Marathon"}, "trigger_offset": [304, 310]}]}
{"id": 17, "schema_version": "3.0", "language": "de", "target": "multi", "text": "Das Berliner Abgeordnetenhaus hat am Donnerstag mit 87 zu 73 Stimmen die Einführung einer Citymaut für die Innenstadt beschlossen. Im Zuge der Vorbereitungen werden die BVG-Buslinien 100 und 200 ab 1. Juli vorübergehend über den Spittelmarkt umgeleitet. Stadtentwicklungssenatorin Linda Wessel sagte, mit der Maßnahme würden täglich rund 60.000 Fahrzeuge aus der Mitte ferngehalten.", "entities": [{"type": "ORG", "text": "Berliner Abgeordnetenhaus", "offset": [4, 29]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "Donnerstag", "offset": [37, 47]}, {"type": "MISC", "text": "87 zu 73", "offset": [52, 60]}, {"type": "MISC", "text": "Citymaut", "offset": [90, 98]}, {"type": "LOC", "text": "Innenstadt", "offset": [107, 117]}, {"type": "ORG", "text": "BVG", "offset": [169, 172]}, {"type": "MISC", "text": "Buslinien 100 und 200", "offset": [173, 194]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "1. Juli", "offset": [198, 205]}, {"type": "FAC", "text": "Spittelmarkt", "offset": [229, 241]}, {"type": "PER", "text": "Linda Wessel", "offset": [281, 293]}, {"type": "NUM", "text": "60.000", "offset": [338, 344]}, {"type": "LOC", "text": "Mitte", "offset": [363, 368]}], "domain_labels": ["politics", "mobility"], "events": [{"event_type": "politics", "event_subtype": "CouncilVote", "trigger": "beschlossen", "slots": {"event_date": "Donnerstag", "policy_topic": "Citymaut", "majority": "87 zu 73", "organizers": ["Berliner Abgeordnetenhaus"], "key_politicians": ["Linda Wessel"]}, "trigger_offset": [118, 129]}, {"event_type": "mobility", "event_subtype": "BusRerouting", "trigger": "umgeleitet", "slots": {"operator": "BVG", "affected_lines": ["Buslinien 100 und 200"], "start_date": "1. Juli", "reason": "Citymaut"}, "trigger_offset": [242, 252]}]}
{"id": 18, "schema_version": "3.0", "language": "en", "target": "multi", "text": "Austin's annual East Side Block Festival kicked off on Saturday afternoon, with five city blocks along East 11th Street closed to traffic until late Sunday evening. Capital Metro rerouted the 17 and 30 bus lines through East 12th Street. By 10 p.m., police estimated the crowd at roughly 14,500, the festival's largest opening night since its 2017 debut.", "entities": [{"type": "LOC", "text": "Austin", "offset": [0, 6]}, {"type": "EVENT", "text": "East Side Block Festival", "offset": [16, 40]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday afternoon", "offset": [55, 73]}, {"type": "NUM", "text": "five", "offset": [80, 84]}, {"type": "FAC", "text": "East 11th Street", "offset": [103, 119]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "late Sunday evening", "offset": [144, 163]}, {"type": "ORG", "text": "Capital Metro", "offset": [165, 178]}, {"type": "MISC", "text": "17 and 30 bus lines", "offset": [192, 211]}, {"type": "FAC", "text": "East 12th Street", "offset": [220, 236]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "10 p.m.", "offset": [241, 248]}, {"type": "NUM", "text": "14,500", "offset": [288, 294]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "2017", "offset": [343, 347]}], "domain_labels": ["cultural", "mobility"], "events": [{"event_type": "cultural", "event_subtype": "Festival", "trigger": "kicked off", "slots": {"event_name": "East Side Block Festival", "city": "Austin", "actual_attendance": 14500, "start_date": "Saturday afternoon", "end_date": "late Sunday evening"}, "trigger_offset": [41, 51]}, {"event_type": "mobility", "event_subtype": "TransitRerouting", "trigger": "rerouted", "slots": {"city": "Austin", "operator": "Capital Metro", "affected_lines": ["17 and 30 bus lines"], "start_date": "Saturday afternoon", "end_date": "late Sunday evening", "reason": "East Side Block Festival"}, "trigger_offset": [179, 187]}]}
{"id": 19, "schema_version": "3.0", "language": "en", "target": "negative", "text": "Plans to extend the Glasgow Subway out to Drumchapel are facing renewed opposition from residents in the Anniesland area, who say the proposed alignment cuts too close to existing housing. Strathclyde Partnership for Transport published an updated feasibility study last week putting the cost of the eight-station extension at £640 million, well above the £450 million estimate from 2019. A public consultation closed in March without a clear preferred route.", "entities": [{"type": "ORG", "text": "Glasgow Subway", "offset": [20, 34]}, {"type": "LOC", "text": "Drumchapel", "offset": [42, 52]}, {"type": "LOC", "text": "Anniesland", "offset": [105, 115]}, {"type": "ORG", "text": "Strathclyde Partnership for Transport", "offset": [189, 226]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "offset": [266, 275]}, {"type": "NUM", "text": "eight-station", "offset": [300, 313]}, {"type": "MONEY", "text": "£640 million", "offset": [327, 339]}, {"type": "MONEY", "text": "£450 million", "offset": [356, 368]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "2019", "offset": [383, 387]}, {"type": "DATE", "text": "March", "offset": [421, 426]}], "domain_labels": [], "events": []}
